  "description": "Use when writing, improving, or debugging unit tests that verify isolated functions, methods, and classes. Covers cross-platform frameworks including Vitest, Jest, xUnit, NUnit, MSTest, pytest, JUnit 5, and Go testing with mocking strategies, test doubles, AAA pattern, and naming conventions. USE FOR: unit test frameworks, Vitest, Jest, xUnit, NUnit, pytest, JUnit, Go test, mocking, test doubles, AAA pattern DO NOT USE FOR: multi-component tests (use integration-testing), browser tests (use e2e-testing), API contract verification (use contract-testing)",
